<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - July 12.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - July 12.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to July 12.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		440	    63,571     52,005</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	  11	     1,426	  855</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	13	     2,611	1,326</p>
<p>Total			  464	    67,894     54,186</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0	     1,027     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 442	  301</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     5,631	1,588</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 160	   34</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     191	    15,631	7,051</p>
<p>Total			  191	    15,791	7,085</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
